{
    "title": "Al QURAN - \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0631\u0622\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645",
    "description": "Al Quran Free - \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0631\u0622\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645 is an authentic Islamic application designed to enhance your worship experience. The Al Quran MP3 app is a versatile tool that caters to the needs of Muslims who desire to Read and listen Holy Quran. Recite Quran Sharif with genuine feeling, like an actual Quran in your hand. \r\n\r\nAl Quran Majeed - \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0631\u0627\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645 application is a free recitation app that presents the 16-line Quran Pak in a flawless format, seamlessly transitioning from paper to the Android screen. Quran Sharif - \u0642\u0631\u0622\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645 is a free recitation app with Mp3 audio feature. Read Quran and listen Quran Pak anywhere, anytime, featuring the voices of 20 renowned reciters. \r\n\r\nThe Holy Quran MP3 app allows you to both read Coran and listen audio recitation of the Quran Kareem, featuring a variety of captivating voices. \r\n\r\nAudio Quran Mp3: \r\nAl kuran sharif app also provides you the facility of Mp3 Quran. Allowing you to listen the audio Quran Pak in high quality with your favourite reciter. You can access the complete Quran mp3 formt. You can read the complete Quran Majeed in form of chapters or listen complete surahs recited by the 20 most renowned reciters. \r\n\r\nPrayer Times: \r\n\r\nAl Quran app - \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0631\u0627\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645 App will notify you at the time of each prayer, helping you to stay connected to your worship. Manually adjust Prayer time setting according to your convenience. Additionally, in Kuran app you can set alarm for each prayer. \r\n\r\nHijri Calendar: \r\n\r\nThe Quran Sharif app also provides the Hijri date, with an available option for hijri date adjustment. You can manually adjust the Hijri date according to your preferences. \r\n\r\nEasy Navigation:\r\n\r\nFrom the main page open any surah index or juzz index for finding the parah or surah which you want to recite or listen. You can also control the audio Quran player from your phone. You can stop, pause, repeat or forward to the next surah. \r\n\r\nMP3 Audio Quran online/offline:\r\n\r\nIn this audio Quran Kareem app, you can listen the recitation both online and offline. If you want to listen Quran recitation offline simply click on the download button located on the right side of every surah in surah index. You can use the al Quran audio app while downloading the surahs, as they will be downloaded on the background of the Quran Karim app. The progress of download can be seen in the notification bar. \r\n\r\nResume Quran (\u0627\u0644\u0642\u0631\u0622\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645): Click on the Resume button, so it will take you to the page where you left off Quran reading. \r\n\r\nBookmark: The abrupt interruption can let you forget the previous reciting page, so before leaving, use bookmarks option of Quran Karim for the continuity of tilawat e Koran Pak from the exact point. \r\n\r\nScreen Light: The screen brightness is adjusted to be compatible with the hours of reciting the Holy Quran. While you engage in your Quran Kareem - \u0642\u0631\u0627\u0646 \u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645 recitation the screen light will not dim or turn off. \r\n\r\nLight/Dark Mode:  The Al Quran Free - \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0631\u0622\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645 application can be used in dark environments and its perfect for night time use. \r\n\r\nFeatures of Daily use of the Holy Quran App: \r\n\u2022 Read and listen Quran Majeed offline \r\n\u2022 Complete 16 lines Coran page \r\n\u2022 Add or delete Bookmarks \r\n\u2022 Light and dark mode \r\n\u2022 Vertical scroll & horizontal scroll \r\n\u2022 Select font with your choice \r\n\u2022 Different localised languages are available \r\n\u2022 Swipe left to right to move on next page \r\n\u2022 Unique and user-friendly interface \r\n\u2022 Clear and best quality of Al Quran audio. \r\n\r\nPlease feel free to let us know if you have any suggestions for improvement of Al Quran Kareem app.\r\nWe're committed to enhancing your experience by utilizing advanced features like FOREGROUND_SERVICE_DATA_SYNC and FOREGROUND_SERVICE_MEDIA_PLAYBACK permissions. With these permissions, we ensure efficient background data synchronization and hassle-free media playback, allowing you to download pages effortlessly while enjoying uninterrupted access to your favorite content.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Al Quran Free - \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0631\u0622\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645 is an authentic Islamic application designed to enhance your worship experience. The Al Quran MP3 app is a versatile tool that caters to the needs of Muslims who desire to Read and listen Holy Quran. Recite Quran Sharif with genuine feeling, like an actual Quran in your hand. <br><br>Al Quran Majeed - \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0631\u0627\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645 application is a free recitation app that presents the 16-line Quran Pak in a flawless format, seamlessly transitioning from paper to the Android screen. Quran Sharif - \u0642\u0631\u0622\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645 is a free recitation app with Mp3 audio feature. Read Quran and listen Quran Pak anywhere, anytime, featuring the voices of 20 renowned reciters. <br><br>The Holy Quran MP3 app allows you to both read Coran and listen audio recitation of the Quran Kareem, featuring a variety of captivating voices. <br><br>Audio Quran Mp3: <br>Al kuran sharif app also provides you the facility of Mp3 Quran. Allowing you to listen the audio Quran Pak in high quality with your favourite reciter. You can access the complete Quran mp3 formt. You can read the complete Quran Majeed in form of chapters or listen complete surahs recited by the 20 most renowned reciters. <br><br>Prayer Times: <br><br>Al Quran app - \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0631\u0627\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645 App will notify you at the time of each prayer, helping you to stay connected to your worship. Manually adjust Prayer time setting according to your convenience. Additionally, in Kuran app you can set alarm for each prayer. <br><br>Hijri Calendar: <br><br>The Quran Sharif app also provides the Hijri date, with an available option for hijri date adjustment. You can manually adjust the Hijri date according to your preferences. <br><br>Easy Navigation:<br><br>From the main page open any surah index or juzz index for finding the parah or surah which you want to recite or listen. You can also control the audio Quran player from your phone. You can stop, pause, repeat or forward to the next surah. <br><br>MP3 Audio Quran online/offline:<br><br>In this audio Quran Kareem app, you can listen the recitation both online and offline. If you want to listen Quran recitation offline simply click on the download button located on the right side of every surah in surah index. You can use the al Quran audio app while downloading the surahs, as they will be downloaded on the background of the Quran Karim app. The progress of download can be seen in the notification bar. <br><br>Resume Quran (\u0627\u0644\u0642\u0631\u0622\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645): Click on the Resume button, so it will take you to the page where you left off Quran reading. <br><br>Bookmark: The abrupt interruption can let you forget the previous reciting page, so before leaving, use bookmarks option of Quran Karim for the continuity of tilawat e Koran Pak from the exact point. <br><br>Screen Light: The screen brightness is adjusted to be compatible with the hours of reciting the Holy Quran. While you engage in your Quran Kareem - \u0642\u0631\u0627\u0646 \u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645 recitation the screen light will not dim or turn off. <br><br>Light/Dark Mode:  The Al Quran Free - \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0631\u0622\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645 application can be used in dark environments and its perfect for night time use. <br><br>Features of Daily use of the Holy Quran App: <br>\u2022 Read and listen Quran Majeed offline <br>\u2022 Complete 16 lines Coran page <br>\u2022 Add or delete Bookmarks <br>\u2022 Light and dark mode <br>\u2022 Vertical scroll &amp; horizontal scroll <br>\u2022 Select font with your choice <br>\u2022 Different localised languages are available <br>\u2022 Swipe left to right to move on next page <br>\u2022 Unique and user-friendly interface <br>\u2022 Clear and best quality of Al Quran audio. <br><br>Please feel free to let us know if you have any suggestions for improvement of Al Quran Kareem app.<br>We&#39;re committed to enhancing your experience by utilizing advanced features like FOREGROUND_SERVICE_DATA_SYNC and FOREGROUND_SERVICE_MEDIA_PLAYBACK permissions. With these permissions, we ensure efficient background data synchronization and hassle-free media playback, allowing you to download pages effortlessly while enjoying uninterrupted access to your favorite content.",
